OL,3,GNEWSANo criminality in death of three
OL,4,Asisters who died in sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police investigation into the deaths
OL,7,Fof three sisters in the sea off the
OL,8,Fcoast of Brighton has concluded, with
OL,9,Fno evidence found of criminality or
OL,10,Fthird-party involvement.
OL,12,FThe bodies of Jane Adetoro, 36,
OL,13,FChristina Walters, 32, and Rebecca
OL,14,FWalters, 31, were recovered from the
OL,15,Fwater near Black Rock on 13 May.
OL,17,FA post-mortem examination found that
OL,18,Fall three women died by drowning,
OL,19,FSussex Police said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
